  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#history-1\n\n> For the purposes of the comparisons in the above substeps, the path and query components can only be the same if the scheme component of both parsed URLs are relative schemes.\n\nThis is the only use of the term \"relative schemes\" (https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-scheme-relative) in the document, so after it gets fixed that can be eliminated.\n",
